# Deployment

Push to `main` may run CI (see `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` if present): build API Docker image → registry → server deploy via `scripts/deploy.sh`.

**Operator docs** (for deploy questions — read these when helping with production):

| Doc | Topic |
|-----|--------|
| [docs/deployment.md](../docs/deployment.md) | Full production setup overview |
| [docs/ses-setup.md](../docs/ses-setup.md) | Amazon SES for invoice email |
| [docs/storage-and-s3.md](../docs/storage-and-s3.md) | S3 bucket layout and IAM |
| `.env.production.example` | Production env template |

**Repo config files:** `amplify.yml`, `docker-compose.prod.yml`, `scripts/set-amplify-env.js`, `scripts/deploy.sh`.

AWS region is **`us-west-2`** (see `aws-region.mdc`). Do not put secrets or personal emails in tracked files.
